{y}Page 100 is teletext, brought back:
{w}the text service built into televisions
from the 1970s, switched off in most
countries in the 2010s. Built for
Kiroween 2026. MIT licence, source code:
{c}github.com/seunghyeon1004/page100-kiro
{w}No adverts, tracking, cookies, accounts.
An AI editor (Claude) shortens news and
history text to fit. Numbers always
come from the data. See {c}802{w}.
